sequenceDiagram
actor User as Usuario
participant Web as Navegador
participant API as API Gateway
participant Payment as Payment Service
participant Wallet as Wallet Service
participant Fraud as Fraud Service
participant Bank as Bank Gateway
participant Notif as Notification Service
User->>Web: 1. Inicia pago (50 COP)
Web->>API: POST /api/v1/payments/initiate
API->>Payment: ValidateAndInitiate
activate Payment
Payment->>Payment: 2. Control de idempotencia (DynamoDB)
Payment->>Payment: 3. Autenticar usuario (JWT)
Payment->>Wallet: 4. Consultar saldo (50 COP available?)
Wallet->>Wallet: Query RDS: wallet.balance >= 50
Wallet-->>Payment: Balance OK
Payment->>Wallet: 5. Fondos de reserva
Wallet->>Wallet: UPDATE wallet: balance -= 50
Wallet-->>Payment: Reservado
Payment-->>API: Response: PENDING
deactivate Payment
API-->>Web: TXN_ID + Status
Web-->>User: "Pago iniciado"
par Fraud Check (Async)
Payment->>Fraud: Score de Transacción
activate Fraud
Fraud->>Fraud: Query historial de usuario
Fraud->>Fraud: ML Model: score = 0.23
Fraud-->>Payment: Bajo riesgo
deactivate Fraud
and Bank Processing
Payment->>Bank: POST /process-payment
activate Bank
Bank->>Bank: Procesar débito
Bank-->>Payment: {status: success, auth_code: ABC123}
deactivate Bank
end
Payment->>Payment: 6. Confirmar transacción
Payment->>Payment: UPDATE: status = CONFIRMED
Payment->>Notif: Publish: PaymentConfirmed
activate Notif
Notif->>User: Enviar notificación por correo electrónico
Notif->>User: Enviar notificación por SMS
deactivate Notif
Payment->>Payment: 7. Almacenar clave de idempotencia (TTL: 24h)
User->>Web: Comprobar la aplicación
Web->>Payment: GET /payments/{TXN_ID}
Payment-->>Web: {status: CONFIRMED, amount: 50}
Web-->>User: "Pago confirmado"